      "content": "hey can u help me out with some lit review stuff? im looking at sociodemographic trends and need a summary of how race/ethnicity correlates with certain crime rates in the US. specifically looking for the main statistical trends that show up in the data. thanks. weight on what the actual for these. weight in on the actual numbers if u can find",
